This code implements a PID-controlled greenhouse heater using a DS18B20 temperature sensor and a relay-driven heater with hardware PWM on a Raspberry Pi 3 Model B+. It handles signals for graceful shutdown, logs data every 5 seconds, and checks for errors in all I/O operations. Adjust the device path in `device_path` to match your specific DS18B20 sensor ID.

