This code sets up a Raspberry Pi to decode NEC IR signals using the `libgpiod` library and publish the decoded commands to an MQTT broker using the `libmosquitto` library. It handles signals for clean shutdown and logs messages to syslog. The actual NEC decoding logic should be implemented in the `alert_callback` function.

